  "worked_solution": "There are $3$ columns in $P$ and $3$ rows in $Q.$ Since the number of columns in $P$ equals the number of rows in $Q,$ the matrices $P$ and $Q$ are conformable for multiplication, and $PQ$ is a $4\\times 7$ matrix:\n\n$$\n{P}_{4\\times \\boxed{\\text{3}}}{\\times }_{\u2713}{Q}_{\\boxed{\\text{3}}\\times 7}={PQ}_{4\\times 7}\n$$",
